{"name":"Magenta Crayon","hex":"#ff55a3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"magenta","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color which is close to the equal mixture of red and blue which is an additive secondary color but a subtractive primary color evoked by the combination of red and light blue."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having the color of fuchsia, fuchsine, light purple."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magenta"},{"term":"crayon","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A stick of colored chalk or wax used for drawing.","A colored pencil, a colouring pencil"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To draw with a crayon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/crayon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Crayon","blocks":[{"text":"A crayon is a stick of pigmented wax used for writing or drawing. Wax crayons differ from pastels, in which the pigment is mixed with a dry binder such as gum arabic, and from oil pastels, where the binder is a mixture of wax and oil."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Crayones_cera.jpg/330px-Crayones_cera.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crayon","wikidata":"Q69158"},{"title":"Magenta","blocks":[{"text":"Magenta is a purplish-pink color. On color wheels of the RGB and CMYK color models, it is located directly midway between blue and red. It is one of the four colors of subtractive ink used in color printing by most color printers, also known as CMYK along with yellow, cyan, and black to make all the other colors and hues. The tone of magenta used in printing, printer's magenta, is redder than the magenta of the RGB (additive) model, the former being closer to rose."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_bird_on_its_head%2C_on_Shinobazu_Pond%2C_Ueno_Park%2C_Tokyo.jpg/330px-Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_bird_on_its_